Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=26}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.75,0:01:54.26,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,哦，你醒啦？！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.97,0:01:59.71,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,大哥！婆婆！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.71,0:02:01.34,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,我這是在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.26,0:02:03.89,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,在我的茶館裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.60,0:02:07.07,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,阿玉！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.36,0:02:10.91,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,你的肚子還好嗎？{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.06,0:02:14.94,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,還會痛嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.39,0:02:25.70,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,我覺得好多了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:29.33,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,藥效好快！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:33.67,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,五指草真是靈丹妙藥。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.67,0:02:36.58,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,謝謝大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.47,0:02:40.32,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,{\i1}忍{\i0}-{\i1}忍{\i0}！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.32,0:02:41.01,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,不過……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.24,0:02:46.47,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,你體內的毒\N沒辦法完全清除。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.47,0:02:51.73,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,所以千萬別再\N喝河裡的水了，阿玉。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.73,0:02:53.98,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,好，我知道了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.15,0:03:01.57,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,別再叫了，肚子！\N這樣有失武士風範！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.57,0:03:03.45,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,水！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.45,0:03:05.95,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,河！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.95,0:03:09.29,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,阿玉！給我站住！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.71,0:03:17.55,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,你絕對不可以……！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.55,0:03:18.92,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.92,0:03:20.05,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.05,0:03:22.09,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,你絕對不可以……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.09,0:03:24.97,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,再喝河裡的水了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.14,0:03:31.69,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,好了，處理好了。不過這只是\N臨時的應急包紮……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.69,0:03:33.98,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,嗯，謝謝。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.46,0:03:38.78,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,你好大隻。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.70,0:03:44.20,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,大媽比你大多了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.52,0:03:51.08,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,謝謝你救我脫離\N那相撲力士的求愛。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.59,0:03:55.67,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我什麼都沒做。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.63,0:04:00.40,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,我忘了自我介紹。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:04.68,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,在下是您卑微的僕人，阿菊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.23,0:04:06.26,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,卑微的僕人？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:10.64,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.56,0:04:14.98,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,我不能！不行！我不能收！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.53,0:04:24.95,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,求求你！請收回去吧，婆婆！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.79,0:04:32.25,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,我連買藥的錢都沒有！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.25,0:04:35.37,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,我根本付不起您的\N{\i1}紅豆湯{\i0}！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.71,0:04:44.01,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,你不用付錢。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.10,0:04:45.76,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.49,0:04:47.68,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,我不能收！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.81,0:04:55.52,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,我知道你和阿菊\N也一直沒什麼東西吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.52,0:04:57.90,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,沒關係。別客氣。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.64,0:05:02.94,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,你已經救了我一命，\N現在還要給我食物！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.94,0:05:05.74,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,我怎麼能收下呢？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.74,0:05:06.99,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,沒關係的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.99,0:05:08.16,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.16,0:05:09.33,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,我說沒關係！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.33,0:05:12.62,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,買藥的錢\N我一定會還給你的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.57,0:05:22.55,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,夠了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.55,0:05:23.51,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.51,0:05:26.22,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,當一個女人端出食物時……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.76,0:05:27.84,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,「我不要。」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.84,0:05:28.97,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,「好吧。」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.43,0:05:33.14,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,你真以為\N她會就這樣收回去嗎？{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.25,0:05:37.35,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,如果你不吃……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.60,0:05:41.57,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,我就把它倒到街上去！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:45.10,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.59,0:05:47.24,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,阿玉，你就吃了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.24,0:05:50.70,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,阿鶴小姐是不會\N接受拒絕的。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:03.80,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,你還要那樣坐到什麼時候？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.80,0:06:08.89,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你該高興才對！今天是你的生日！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.89,0:06:10.68,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,是真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.23,0:06:12.64,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我聽說是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.64,0:06:16.57,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,那麼，就當作是生日禮物……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.03,0:06:18.35,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,快吃吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.82,0:07:12.07,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,太好吃了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.82,0:07:17.54,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,這湯真是太美味了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.83,0:07:19.69,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.45,0:07:23.54,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,這是你第一次喝嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.54,0:07:24.59,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.34,0:07:32.09,Flashbacks-207+,Sukiyaki,0,0,0,,你以為她上一次吃東西\N是多少天前了？！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.09,0:07:37.38,Flashbacks-207+,Sukiyaki,0,0,0,,儘管她每天拼命\N織帽子、賣帽子，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.38,0:07:41.48,Flashbacks-207+,Sukiyaki,0,0,0,,賺到的錢卻連\N養活一個人都勉強！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.95,0:07:53.67,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,裡面居然還有{\i1}麻糬{\i0}！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.38,0:07:56.95,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,真是奢侈的享受！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.09,0:08:02.21,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你不能用臉頰\N變出一些嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.51,0:08:07.29,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,那種東西可填不飽肚子的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.29,0:08:10.26,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,好吃好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.00,0:08:16.43,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,婆婆！非常感謝您！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.85,0:08:23.31,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,我這輩子再也遇不到\N比這更棒的生日了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.18,0:08:26.87,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,真可惜我師父沒能一起享用！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.80,0:08:34.99,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,阿鶴……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.58,0:08:47.70,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,這是我這輩子最棒的一天！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.81,0:09:09.61,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,像她這樣的孩子……\N並不罕見……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.67,0:09:12.88,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,在和之國……這裡……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.88,0:09:17.45,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,真不敢相信，像她這麼小的孩子\N竟然連飯都吃不飽！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.45,0:09:21.60,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,至少等你長大後，\N就能承受那些毒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.60,0:09:22.58,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,不，承受不了的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.16,0:09:28.96,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\q2}這裡有海、有山、有森林，\N取得食物本不該是難事。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.93,0:09:31.09,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,沒錯。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.71,0:09:34.88,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,要是我們沒有親手\N把這一切給毀了就好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.97,0:09:40.64,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,該死的凱多！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.68,0:09:42.97,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,是啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.19,0:09:48.48,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,你們真是善良的年輕人。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.35,0:09:52.07,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,對了！你們叫什麼名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.56,0:09:56.17,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我叫索隆十郎。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.17,0:09:57.49,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我是個浪人。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.40,0:09:59.87,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我是蒙其·D·—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.78,0:10:14.43,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,他的名字是……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.33,0:10:18.43,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,魯夫太郎。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.43,0:10:19.61,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.30,0:10:22.43,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,對……沒錯……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.55,0:10:25.98,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我是魯夫太郎……！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.77,0:10:27.90,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,呃……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:29.10,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,是也……？{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.61,0:10:35.11,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,你們是外來者吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.19,0:10:38.49,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,進這個國家一定很不容易吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.49,0:10:40.20,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你怎麼看出來的？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.20,0:10:42.02,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,你們說話怪怪的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.02,0:10:42.99,Main-207+,Luffy+Zoro,0,0,0,,– 什麼？！\N– 什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.99,0:10:46.80,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,別擔心。我不會告訴任何人。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.79,0:10:51.81,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,我也是剛來這個鎮上的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.81,0:10:56.34,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,阿菊也才在這裡\N工作了一個月。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.34,0:11:00.05,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我聽說這個鎮叫施捨小鎮。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.05,0:11:02.44,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,這是什麼名字啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.44,0:11:03.97,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,這名字本身就說明了一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.01,0:11:10.70,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,意思是「殘羹剩飯」，我們靠著隔壁鎮\N官員們吃剩的東西過活。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.25,0:11:14.90,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,阿玉說某個地方\N有不含毒的食物。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.90,0:11:17.03,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,你們看那邊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.02,0:11:21.60,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,看到那座沒有煙囪的山了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.18,0:11:26.70,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,很久以前，御田城\N就矗立在那座山頂上。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.80,0:11:30.92,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,已經過去二十年了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:36.13,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,御田……這名字我聽過。\N不過是在哪聽過的呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.13,0:11:39.45,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,直到大約二十年前……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.12,0:11:45.06,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,光月家曾長久\N統治著和之國。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.11,0:11:52.93,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,在那座山腳下\N有一大片農場……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.93,0:11:56.21,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,那是已故的御田大人\N所開闢的……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.21,0:12:00.46,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,曾為九里的人民\N提供美味的食物。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.46,0:12:26.39,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,它可不是為了讓大蛇和他的爪牙\N壟斷全國糧食而建的。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.49,0:12:31.60,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,樂園農場……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.09,0:12:35.52,Main-207+,Batman,0,0,0,,我聽得到喔！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.52,0:12:39.57,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,那麼那裡的食物沒毒嗎？{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:41.82,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,沒錯。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:47.03,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,那裡有安全又美味的食物、\N乾淨的水，還有衣服。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.03,0:12:49.37,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,然而，那一切都屬於……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.37,0:12:53.28,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,大蛇將軍！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.07,0:13:01.05,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,神社鳥居的另一頭，\N有一個官員居住的鎮。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.69,0:13:08.26,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,為了活下去，我們求他們把腐爛的食物\N和他們不要的東西賣給我們。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.29,0:13:12.27,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,施捨小鎮，「殘羹剩飯」之鎮……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.27,0:13:16.77,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,我們勉強度日。至少，還能活得下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.31,0:14:08.36,Main-207+,Batman,0,0,0,,你想幹嘛？！\N別擋我的路！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.66,0:14:12.77,Main-207+,Batman,0,0,0,,我聽到你說的話了，女人！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.77,0:14:15.62,Main-207+,Batman,0,0,0,,你剛才在說將軍的壞話！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.75,0:14:21.50,Main-207+,Batman,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(960,225.6)}我的聽力\N比一般人靈敏六倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.50,0:14:24.59,Main-207+,Batman,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(960,225.6)}對將軍不敬的話\N我一句都不會漏聽！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.27,0:14:30.43,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,這麼說你是聽到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.43,0:14:33.26,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,難道就憑這個\N就要取她性命嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.04,0:14:36.06,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,你要是打中她，她會沒命的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.28,0:14:42.19,Main-207+,Batman,0,0,0,,只要你乖乖安分過活，\N我就很少需要動手傷你！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.22,0:14:44.86,Main-207+,Batman,0,0,0,,但大蛇將軍……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.86,0:14:50.32,Main-207+,Batman,0,0,0,,可不會容許有謀反之心的人活著！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.98,0:15:26.32,Main-207+,Batman,0,0,0,,我的箭！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.23,0:15:29.74,Main-207+,Batman,0,0,0,,全被他擋下來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.74,0:15:32.01,Main-207+,Batman,0,0,0,,你是誰？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.01,0:15:36.03,Main-207+,Batman,0,0,0,,這幾週來，一直有人\N在偷農場的東西。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.03,0:15:40.25,Main-207+,Batman,0,0,0,,我們正在搜捕犯人！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.25,0:15:43.42,Main-207+,Batman,0,0,0,,說不定一直以來\N就是你們兩個幹的！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.59,0:15:51.84,Main-207+,Batman,0,0,0,,一個獨眼浪人？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.23,0:15:58.02,Main-207+,Batman,0,0,0,,我在通緝令上見過他！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:16.70,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,放開我！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:19.45,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,你是誰？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.22,0:16:21.37,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,阿玉！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.96,0:16:25.46,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,救命！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.46,0:16:28.42,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.70,0:16:30.59,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,阿玉……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.09,0:16:34.47,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,阿玉！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.86,0:16:39.06,Main-207+,Gazelleman,0,0,0,,任務達成！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.35,0:16:45.02,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,把阿玉還來！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.74,0:17:00.29,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,阿菊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.38,0:17:09.88,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,一把刀？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.97,0:17:13.38,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,他跑得好快！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.80,0:17:15.88,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,放開我！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.26,0:17:18.64,Main-207+,Gazelleman,0,0,0,,閉嘴，你這臭小鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.97,0:17:21.35,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,我要跳上去囉，獅子狗大人！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.95,0:17:27.84,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,過來，乖狗狗！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.15,0:17:37.95,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,那女人有把刀！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.95,0:17:39.91,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,她說她懂得怎麼用……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.56,0:17:43.75,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,雖然我從沒見過她出手……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.71,0:17:48.58,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,停下，乖狗狗！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.58,0:17:50.84,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,帶我一起去！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.50,0:17:55.42,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,看他的手臂！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.63,0:17:59.47,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.47,0:18:01.52,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我也要去！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.52,0:18:02.31,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.73,0:18:07.93,Main-207+,Batman,0,0,0,,那些畜生！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.49,0:18:14.11,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,魯夫太郎！索隆十郎！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.04,0:18:19.49,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,他們為什麼要抓那孩子？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.49,0:18:23.12,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,我也不清楚，但我們得把她救回來！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.37,0:18:27.78,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,阿玉！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.78,0:18:30.83,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我一定會救你的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.39,0:18:33.75,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.18,0:18:41.01,Main-207+,Batman,0,0,0,,瞪羚人！給我跑得像風一樣快！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:43.31,Main-207+,Gazelleman,0,0,0,,遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.93,0:18:50.40,Main-207+,Batman,0,0,0,,真是窩囊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.52,0:18:55.13,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.13,0:18:58.04,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,他們一定是計劃好\N要綁架她的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.04,0:19:02.23,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,肯定是哪個真打下的命令！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.23,0:19:05.66,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,那個方向只有一個地方\N可以去……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.67,0:19:09.50,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,官員之鎮。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.79,0:19:12.75,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,一本筆記本？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.47,0:19:16.26,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,那座鎮上有三名真打。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.15,0:19:18.36,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,霍金斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.34,0:19:20.39,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,赫戴姆。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.57,0:19:23.30,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,斯皮德。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.30,0:19:24.79,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,除此之外……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:30.51,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,還有大約三十名戰士，擁有來自\N那些奇怪人造果實的特殊能力。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.73,0:19:36.58,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,你可不是普通女人。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.77,0:19:40.21,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,你到底是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.20,0:19:48.66,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,在下……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.25,0:19:51.53,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,是名武士。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.82,0:20:02.09,Main-207+,Gazelleman,0,0,0,,赫戴姆老大！我是瞪羚人！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.66,0:20:08.44,Main-207+,Gazelleman,0,0,0,,{\i1}我抓到那個據說\N馴服了我們狒狒的臭小鬼！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.56,0:20:12.85,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,放開我！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.87,0:20:16.28,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,幹得好……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.28,0:20:18.82,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,她能派上大用場。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.38,0:20:20.77,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,{\i1}把她帶過來。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.77,0:20:21.60,Main-207+,Gazelleman,0,0,0,,是，老大！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.89,0:20:40.67,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,魯夫大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.03,0:20:49.12,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(960,225.6)}這裡是博羅鎮，\N和之國九里地區一座繁榮的城鎮。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.36,0:21:00.48,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.94,0:21:05.32,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,那個討厭的浪人！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.32,0:21:08.86,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,我因為他那股\N異常強大的氣勢而退縮了，{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.86,0:21:13.81,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,但我無論如何\N都想娶阿菊當我的妻子！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.08,0:21:20.06,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,我有崇高的社會地位、響亮的名聲，\N還能取得安全的食物來源。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.70,0:21:24.63,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,她要是拒絕我就是瘋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.43,0:21:33.31,Main-207+,Mouseman,0,0,0,,別為這種小事操心了，你這白痴！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.83,0:21:37.32,Main-207+,Mouseman,0,0,0,,她只是施捨小鎮來的女孩，對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.32,0:21:42.43,Main-207+,Mouseman,0,0,0,,那種人低賤到連大蛇將軍\N都懶得去管他們……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.74,0:21:49.12,Main-207+,Mouseman,0,0,0,,她愛不愛你\N根本無關緊要。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.12,0:21:52.61,Main-207+,Mouseman,0,0,0,,你可以直接強迫她成婚……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.61,0:21:55.08,Main-207+,Mouseman,0,0,0,,或者你可以燒了她家……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.90,0:22:00.60,Main-207+,Mouseman,0,0,0,,再殺光她所有的親人，\N讓她走投無路。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.15,0:22:06.17,Main-207+,Mouseman,0,0,0,,孤立她，讓她只能依靠你！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.30,0:22:12.06,Main-207+,Mouseman,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(960,106.3)}你可是武士階級的人！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.06,0:22:16.77,Main-207+,Mouseman,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(960,741)}在和之國，我們的身分制度\N分得清清楚楚。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.77,0:22:26.90,Main-207+,Mouseman,0,0,0,,你是我們國技的明星，要是你\N還去在乎那種低賤的人，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.61,0:22:30.76,Main-207+,Mouseman,0,0,0,,那可就給別人立下壞榜樣了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.74,0:22:35.45,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,你說得對！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.91,0:22:41.25,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,對！我想怎麼對阿菊都行！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.03,0:22:48.63,Main-207+,Hiroshi,0,0,0,,橫綱大人……\N您不喜歡這些菜嗎？{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.97,0:22:55.43,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,那是隻{\i1}狸貓{\i0}，對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.43,0:22:59.64,Main-207+,Hiroshi,0,0,0,,是的，這是我們養了很久的寵物……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.94,0:23:02.05,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,煮來吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.05,0:23:02.98,Main-207+,Hiroshi,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.77,0:23:07.44,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,{\i1}狸貓{\i0}是我最愛吃的！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.45,0:23:36.28,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,你們終於來了……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.24,0:23:53.04,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,我看到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.54,0:23:58.79,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,我們直接衝進去！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.79,0:24:00.96,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,魯夫太郎、索隆十郎！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.83,0:24:05.92,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,過了那裡就是博羅鎮！\N官員和海賊之鎮！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.54,0:24:08.63,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,我無法保證我們的安全。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.67,0:24:15.89,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,你們準備好了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.23,0:24:18.22,Main-207+,Luffy+Zoro,0,0,0,,– 好！\N– 好！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.70,0:24:25.29,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,是這丫頭嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.04,0:24:29.94,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,可憐的孩子……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.69,0:24:33.41,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,她快哭了。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.08,0:24:39.51,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,我才不會哭！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.33,0:24:46.49,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,別逞強了！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.10,0:24:59.60,Main-207+,Gazelleman,0,0,0,,好痛……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.79,0:25:12.03,Main-207+,Gazelleman,0,0,0,,我岔氣了！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.29,0:25:18.07,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,閉嘴！瞪羚人！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.88,0:25:31.52,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,你可以退下了！\N你這粗重的喘氣聲很煩人！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.68,0:25:42.32,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,給我把體力練好，你這蠢貨！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.10,0:25:52.73,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,我又不是在跟你說話！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.56,0:25:58.24,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,別那樣盯著我看！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.13,0:26:19.03,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,我好怕喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.54,0:26:22.56,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,他的肚子是隻獅子！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.39,0:26:32.11,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,哦？你敢用那種挑釁的眼神看我？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.11,0:26:48.58,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.58,0:26:52.17,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,又來了！獅子咬中他的蛋蛋了！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.16,0:26:58.13,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,不過……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.13,0:27:05.56,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,由於他們共用一個身體，\N他的胯下也算是獅子的！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.40,0:27:12.27,Main-207+,Soldier,0,0,0,,他怎麼就是學不乖？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.27,0:27:14.11,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,赫戴姆老大。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.11,0:27:16.65,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,這臭小鬼該怎麼處置？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.66,0:27:18.95,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,赫戴姆老大！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.58,0:27:21.45,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,原來你叫阿玉。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.77,0:27:32.33,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,像你這種軟弱的小屁孩……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.12,0:27:38.38,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,是怎麼馴服一頭兇猛狒狒的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.38,0:27:41.50,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,我的手下親眼看到你做的！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.32,0:28:03.24,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,別裝作一副不知情的樣子！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.24,0:28:07.84,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,你一定擁有真正的惡魔果實能力。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.19,0:28:12.43,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,快說……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.17,0:28:15.04,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,給我招出來！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.06,0:28:19.34,Flashbacks-207+,Sukiyaki,0,0,0,,阿玉！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.34,0:28:23.86,Flashbacks-207+,Sukiyaki,0,0,0,,你的能力可能會\N被敵人覬覦。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.86,0:28:27.56,Flashbacks-207+,Sukiyaki,0,0,0,,你絕不能被人看見\N使用它！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.44,0:28:41.65,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,我……我只是……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.45,0:28:45.45,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,動物……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.18,0:28:50.54,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,都很喜歡我。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.30,0:28:54.45,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.45,0:28:56.08,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,原來如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.08,0:28:59.07,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,就只是這樣啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.52,0:29:03.84,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,是的，沒錯。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.47,0:29:07.10,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,你當我是傻子嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.68,0:29:12.90,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,你這臭小鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.50,0:29:22.33,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,「她扯下了自己的一塊臉頰。」\N他們是這麼跟我說的。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.91,0:29:38.84,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,你要是不肯告訴我……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.36,0:29:43.72,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,我就自己來試試。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.72,0:29:45.97,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,喂，給我拿把鉗子來！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.97,0:29:47.22,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,是，老大！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.43,0:29:54.94,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,不是那把！拿大一點的！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.32,0:30:02.57,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,魯夫大哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.04,0:30:20.63,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,救命！魯夫大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.75,0:30:25.30,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,阿玉！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.45,0:30:34.06,Main-207+,Guard,0,0,0,,給我站住！你們不想活了嗎？！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.06,0:30:35.85,Main-207+,Guard,0,0,0,,有入侵者！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.47,0:30:38.69,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,博羅鎮就在他們前方！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.69,0:30:42.44,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,魯夫！我們沒時間\N跟這些雜魚糾纏！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.81,0:30:45.11,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.11,0:30:47.57,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,繼續衝就對了，乖狗狗！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.70,0:30:54.83,Main-207+,Bepo,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.43,0:30:57.25,Main-207+,Bepo,0,0,0,,隊長！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.44,0:31:00.15,Main-207+,Bepo,0,0,0,,我們有麻煩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.27,0:31:06.01,Main-207+,Bepo,0,0,0,,隊長！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.01,0:31:08.67,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,什麼事？你怎麼這麼慌張？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.07,0:31:12.43,Main-207+,Bepo,0,0,0,,是草帽小子和羅羅亞！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.86,0:31:18.71,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,草帽來和之國了？！\N所以……他終於來了……
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.71,0:31:23.11,Main-207+,Bepo,0,0,0,,草帽和羅羅亞\N正在猛攻博羅鎮！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.36,0:31:28.60,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,喂，等等！那只會\N惹出一堆麻煩！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.60,0:31:30.49,Main-207+,Shachi,0,0,0,,差不多吧……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.20,0:31:33.28,Main-207+,Bepo,0,0,0,,隊長？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.97,0:31:37.58,Main-207+,Bepo,0,0,0,,隊長？！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.78,0:31:42.13,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,我們去阻止那些蠢貨！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.87,0:31:44.71,Main-207+,Bepo,0,0,0,,遵命，隊長！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.26,0:31:55.89,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,別這麼做……
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.91,0:32:01.97,Main-207+,Holdem,0,0,0,,只要你讓我見識一下你的能力，\N我就住手。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.03,0:32:25.29,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,阿玉！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.33,0:32:42.14,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.14,0:32:43.98,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,你動了什麼手腳？！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.37,0:32:47.52,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,那是霸氣！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.52,0:32:48.59,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,霸氣？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.48,0:32:51.24,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,霸王色霸氣。
